## XcodeGen
## project.yml is the source of truth — regenerate with `xcodegen generate`
## after editing it. We do commit the resulting .xcodeproj so Xcode Cloud
## can build straight from GitHub without needing to run xcodegen first.
## User-state and workspace files inside the .xcodeproj stay ignored above.

